	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d24r0401_swbell_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ここって……　なんだろ
なんだか　ふしぎな　かんじ▼
もしかして　ここが
リバースマウンテンの　みなもと……▽
ポケモン　ヒードランの　すみか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-27T06:40:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T10:24:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ここって……　なんだろ
なんだか　不思議な　感じ▼
もしかして　ここが
リバースマウンテンの　源と……▽
ポケモン　ヒードランの　すみか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-27T06:40:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T10:29:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・posまで誘導しメッセージ表示</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T10:30:32" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBELL
ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T10:24:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T05:58:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
